{"type":"iteration","iteration":3,"runId":"2026-10-19T08:18:18.987Z","sessionId":"2026-10-19T08:18:18.987Z","lineageId":"2026-10-19T08:18:18.987Z","mode":"research","target_agent":"deep-research","agent_definition_loaded":true,"resolved_route":"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research","newInfoRatio":0.72,"noveltyJustification":"This pass newly located a verifier inventory gap, a replay-model Obsidian omission, and the limits of advisor hints; it also confirmed the leaf router blocks already share a parseable schema with hub-owned load tiers.","status":"insight","focus":"Q3: How should hard-coded surface lists be replaced by derivation from mode-registry.json packetKind: surface, and what single shape should the three §2b blocks (intent signals, DEFAULT_RESOURCE, load tiers) share, given compiled-route and advisor surface-hint behaviour?","answeredQuestions":["Q3: How should hard-coded surface lists be replaced by derivation from mode-registry.json packetKind: surface, and what single shape should the three §2b blocks (intent signals, DEFAULT_RESOURCE, load tiers) share, given compiled-route and advisor surface-hint behaviour?"],"graphEvents":[{"type":"node","id":"q3-iter003","kind":"QUESTION","label":"Q3 surface inventory and routing contract"},{"type":"node","id":"f-iter003-001","kind":"FINDING","label":"Finding 001"},{"type":"node","id":"f-iter003-002","kind":"FINDING","label":"Finding 002"},{"type":"node","id":"f-iter003-003","kind":"FINDING","label":"Finding 003"},{"type":"node","id":"f-iter003-004","kind":"FINDING","label":"Finding 004"},{"type":"node","id":"s-registry","kind":"SOURCE","label":"Mode registry","path":".skilled/skills/sk-code/mode-registry.json"},{"type":"node","id":"s-verifier","kind":"SOURCE","label":"Router sync guard","path":".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/scripts/verify-router-sync.cjs"},{"type":"node","id":"s-doc-claims","kind":"SOURCE","label":"Documentation claim guard","path":".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-c